WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.287
Sid was walking.

2
00:00:08.288 --> 00:00:14.315
He walked through a field.

3
00:00:14.316 --> 00:00:22.098
He ate some grass.

4
00:00:22.099 --> 00:00:30.060
Sid walked past some trees.

5
00:00:30.061 --> 00:00:38.407
He ate some leaves.

6
00:00:38.408 --> 00:00:41.828
Then Sid found a berry patch.

7
00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:45.804
The berries were big and purple.

8
00:00:45.805 --> 00:00:49.000
"Mmm!" Sid said.

9
00:00:49.001 --> 00:00:58.726
"Those berries look sweet!"

10
00:00:58.727 --> 00:01:02.387
Sid ate a berry.

11
00:01:02.388 --> 00:01:04.834
"Yum!" he said.

12
00:01:04.835 --> 00:01:12.873
Sid ate more berries.

13
00:01:12.874 --> 00:01:18.443
Sid ate and ate.

14
00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:21.063
Suddenly he heard his friends.

15
00:01:21.064 --> 00:01:22.736
"Sid!"

16
00:01:22.737 --> 00:01:25.284
"Sid, where are you?"

17
00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:27.804
"Uh-oh," Sid thought.

18
00:01:27.805 --> 00:01:32.642
"My friends will want berries too.

19
00:01:32.643 --> 00:01:41.316
They will eat all of them!"

20
00:01:41.317 --> 00:01:49.487
Sara, Tor, and Rex were walking.

21
00:01:49.488 --> 00:01:53.685
"Maybe Sid went this way," Rex said.

22
00:01:53.686 --> 00:01:57.043
Tor and Sara followed Rex.

23
00:01:57.044 --> 00:02:00.938
They found a field.

24
00:02:00.939 --> 00:02:04.367
Tor gasped. "Look!"

25
00:02:04.368 --> 00:02:11.738
Sid lay on the ground.

26
00:02:11.739 --> 00:02:16.553
He moaned.

27
00:02:16.554 --> 00:02:21.623
Purple spots covered him.

28
00:02:21.624 --> 00:02:24.511
"Poor Sid," Sara said.

29
00:02:24.512 --> 00:02:28.739
"He's sick!"

